---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the coffee roastery and its story">
  <section class="space-y-10">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold">Our story</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl leading-8 text-slate-300">We roast thoughtfully sourced beans and deliver a clean, memorable website experience. This static site is built for low-maintenance updates and strong search performance.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Roasting philosophy</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Highlight your approach to sourcing, blends, and roasting profiles.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Why static?</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">Static sites are fast, secure, and easy to host with free deployment platforms.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Our mission</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">To craft coffee that feels personal and consistent, while creating a sustainable and welcoming experience for every customer.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">The team</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">A small team of roasters, tasters, and storytellers focused on quality, transparency, and building meaningful relationships with growers and customers alike.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/80 p-8">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Community & sustainability</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">We partner with local cafés and growers to reduce waste, support fair pricing, and build a coffee culture rooted in care and craftsmanship.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-slate-300">From compostable packaging to seasonal pop-ups, our goal is to make great coffee enjoyable and responsible for everyone.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
